   "stamp": "Rorschach's journal. October 31st. 11:52.",
   "line": "Omar sees a superhero's origin story, masks and all. Every secret identity needs a cover job. Omar's is the friend who swears they'll Venmo you Friday.",
   "text": "Rorschach's journal. October 31st. 11:52. Omar sees a superhero's origin story, masks and all. Every secret identity needs a cover job. Omar's is the friend who swears they'll Venmo you Friday.",
