   "createdAt": "2026-10-31T15:51:27.251Z",
   "stamp": "Rorschach's journal. October 31st. 11:51.",
   "line": "Inaam sees nothing, then everything, then a pillar full of faces. Diagnosis: forty browser tabs open, and still no idea which one is playing the music.",
   "text": "Rorschach's journal. October 31st. 11:51. Inaam sees nothing, then everything, then a pillar full of faces. Diagnosis: forty browser tabs open, and still no idea which one is playing the music.",
