   "stamp": "Rorschach's journal. October 31st. 10:18.",
   "line": "Swailma sees lungs. Inhales the whole city, exhales nothing but rent complaints. Diagnosis: still holding their breath since the lease renewal.",
   "text": "Rorschach's journal. October 31st. 10:18. Swailma sees lungs. Inhales the whole city, exhales nothing but rent complaints. Diagnosis: still holding their breath since the lease renewal.",
