   "stamp": "Rorschach's journal. October 31st. 10:17.",
   "line": "Swailma sees Juggernaut. Helmet on, shoulder down, mowing through every plan. Swailma, the Thursday dinner was a suggestion.",
   "text": "Rorschach's journal. October 31st. 10:17. Swailma sees Juggernaut. Helmet on, shoulder down, mowing through every plan. Swailma, the Thursday dinner was a suggestion.",
