   "createdAt": "2026-10-31T14:16:01.673Z",
   "stamp": "Rorschach's journal. October 31st. 10:16.",
   "line": "Swailma sees a CT scan of a skull. Wants to see right through everybody, one thin slice at a time. Case note: Swailma has scanned the group chat twice. Still no brain.",
